        "title": "CrossfireX",
        "extract": "CrossfireX was a first-person shooter game developed and published by Smilegate Entertainment and released for Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S on February 10, 2022. The game was the third installment in the Crossfire series. Remedy Entertainment worked on the game's two single-player campaigns, which are also available on Crossfire HD. It received generally negative reviews from critics. CrossfireX was shut down on May 18, 2023.\n\n",
